      "put": {
        "operationId": "replaceContact",
        "summary": "Replace all editable fields",
        "description": "Omitted or null optional fields become empty and are absent from the response. Required name must be supplied. Update-only: a missing contact returns 404. Conditions are optional; omitting them permits last-write-wins. Compare and mutate under the same lock. Domain validation and ordinary errors precede condition evaluation. Body limit: 4096 bytes; no compression.",
