        "description": "Omitted members remain unchanged; null removes optional data. Removing required name fails. Empty/blank optional text normalizes to absence. Only object patches over writable fields are supported. Update-only: a missing contact returns 404. Conditions are optional; omitting them permits last-write-wins. Compare and mutate under the same lock. Domain validation and ordinary errors precede condition evaluation. Body limit: 4096 bytes; no compression.",
